// the following book and code:
//
// - Chapter 6. Building Our Own "Arc" of the Rust Atomics and Locks book.
//     - Rust Atomics and Locks by Mara Bos (O’Reilly). Copyright 2023 Mara Bos,
//       ISBN: 978-1-098-11944-7
